(prediction S/√(S + σ&lt;sub&gt;r&lt;/sub&gt;²) = ${(camOut.theory / Math.sqrt(camOut.theory + cam.rn ** 2)).toFixed(1)}) · dynamic range N&lt;sub&gt;FW&lt;/sub&gt;/σ&lt;sub&gt;r&lt;/sub&gt; = ${cam.rn &gt; 0 ? (20 * Math.log10(cam.fw / cam.rn)).toFixed(0) + " dB" : "∞"} ·
